     "body": "<p>A potentially different approach could be for Fedora to prefix all files it creates with something like \"fcrepo-\". So in the example in this ticket we would have:<br/>\nlicense.txt # user creates<br/>\nfcrepo-license.txt-description.nt (or fcrepo-license.txt.nt)<br/>\nlicense.txt-description.nt # user creates<br/>\nfcrepo-license.txt-description.nt-description.nt (or fcrepo-license.txt-description.nt)</p>",
     "created": "05/May/20 12:03 PM",
     "id": "21172",
     "jsdPublic": true,
